            <title>[ZEPPELIN-716] Deadlock in RemoteInterpreter.open &amp; RemoteInterpreter.init</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-716</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When multiple paragraph jobs are initializing/running at the same time, there is a circular wait between RemoteInterpreterProcess and InterpreterGroup in RemoteInterpreter.init() and RemoteInterpreter.open()&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Full stack trace will be attached&lt;/p&gt;</description>
